# starformation_and_feedback with R2's flags (SFprescription 1: sfr_br06 with radial
# integration, BulgeSizeOn 3), at substep 0, on a real R2 central with its cold gas raised
# by 25%: gas-unstable after the feedback, so the wrapper's instability
# (R/src/model_starformation_and_feedback.c:1088) runs its c06 continuation
# (R/src/model_disk_instability.c:90-108): grow_black_hole with its hydrogen cap (state
# after it in intermediate.after_bh.*), then the mode-1 burst with the commits' caps and
# the refresh (R/src/model_mergers.c:798-803), which replaces the H I the disk SF reduced
# for ionisation (S:1036-1045) with the full atomic remainder; then the yield.
# galaxy 0: R2 reference /Volumes/Internal/results/sage26-campaign/workspace/e01-reference/out/R2/model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256 c6af6c9385d41adcccbd5f19e064323486706b0965183f61ebded290331f6714), Snap_63 row 15138 (GalaxyIndex 3000293000000000, Type 0).
# End-of-snapshot output values used as plausible call inputs, not reconstructed call-time
# state (the writer stores these fields verbatim; DiskScaleRadius is the output's DiskRadius).
# Constructed: ColdGas and MetalsColdGas 1.25 times the output values (a plausible call-time
# inflow: the R2 centrals sit at their Toomre threshold at the end of the snapshot, as the R0
# and R1 central fixtures say), OutflowRate 0 (its value at substep 0 after the first-occupied
# reset, R/src/core_build_model.c:276) and zero histories, as at substep 0; the timing is the
# R1 template's plausible values.
# Reachability: R2-reachable.
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine starformation_and_feedback

i32 params.SFprescription 1  # R2 (R2.par:48): BR06 with radial integration
i32 params.H2RadialIntegrationOn 1  # SAGE26's default, R/src/core_read_parameter_file.c:99; R2.par does not set it
i32 params.H2RadialNBins 25  # default, R/src/core_read_parameter_file.c:100
f64 params.H2RadialRMaxFactor 0x4014000000000000  # 5  (default, R/src/core_read_parameter_file.c:101)
i32 params.SupernovaRecipeOn 1  # R2.par:50
i32 params.CGMrecipeOn 0  # R2.par:54
i32 params.FIREmodeOn 0  # R2.par:55
i32 params.EnhancedStarFormationOn 0  # R2.par:58
i32 params.BulgeSizeOn 3  # R2 (R2.par:109, as R1)
i32 params.KarpovModeOn 0  # default, R/src/core_read_parameter_file.c:130; R2.par does not set it
i32 params.SaveFullSFH 0  # R2.par:60
i32 params.AGNrecipeOn 2  # R2.par:49
i32 params.StarburstColdGasOn 1  # default, R/src/core_read_parameter_file.c:109; R2.par does not set it
i32 params.DiskInstabilityOn 1  # R2.par:52
f64 params.SfrEfficiency 0x0000000000000000  # 0
